flowchart TB
    Presentation[Presentation: SwiftUI and AppKit]
    Application[Application: use cases, ports, state machines]
    Domain[Domain: entities, values, deterministic rules]
    Infrastructure[Infrastructure: macOS, files, workers, providers]
    Contracts[Contracts resources: schemas, examples, scenarios]
    ContractTests[Cross-layer conformance tests]
    Composition[Composition root]

    Presentation --> Application
    Application --> Domain
    Infrastructure --> Application
    Infrastructure --> Domain
    Composition --> Presentation
    Composition --> Application
    Composition --> Infrastructure
    ContractTests --> Contracts
    ContractTests --> Presentation
    ContractTests --> Application
    ContractTests --> Infrastructure

    %% Contracts is a dependency-free resource package. Domain remains serialization-free.
